            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "But Schwarz, there is one thing I have to correct. I wasn't giving you an order. That was just a request from a friend."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "If you ever need anything from me, just tell me."
